OL,3,GNEWSAFamily fears for IPP prisoner sent
OL,4,Aback to jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man serving an
OL,7,Findefinite prison sentence say they
OL,8,Ffear for his health after he was
OL,9,Ftransferred back to jail from a secure
OL,10,Fpsychiatric hospital.
OL,12,FThomas White, 43, was given an
OL,13,FImprisonment for Public Protection
OL,14,F(IPP) sentence for stealing a mobile
OL,15,Fphone in 2012. The sentences, which
OL,16,Fhave no fixed release date, were
OL,17,Fabolished four months later.
OL,19,FHis sister, Clara White, said he was "a
OL,20,Fseverely unwell man who needs
OL,21,Ftreatment, stability and hope".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
